{"name": "东莱馋房(环球金融中心店)", "name_en": "Donglai Chanfang", "match_restaurant_id": null, "brand_group": "东莱餐饮集团", "brand_confirmed": true, "scene": "正餐", "cuisine_paths": [["中餐", "鲁菜", "胶东菜(福山派)"]], "form": "Casual Dining", "meals": ["午餐", "晚餐"], "ingredients": ["海鲜", "肉禽"], "awards": {"michelin": "无", "black_pearl": 0, "source_url": null}, "special_tags": ["可预订", "包间"], "price_avg": 200, "price_range": "¥150-250", "tier": "高档", "district": "浦东新区", "address": "上海市浦东新区陆家嘴环路1000号恒生银行大厦(环球金融中心)2-3楼", "business_area": "陆家嘴", "lat": 31.235, "lng": 121.505, "coord_source": "manual", "phone": null, "booking_method": "电话/大众点评预订；3楼包房制", "signature_dishes": ["葱烧海参", "油爆海螺", "九转大肠", "油淋鸟贝", "海肠捞饭", "椒麻天鹅蛋"], "status": "active", "closed_date": null, "closed_source": null, "scores": {"objective": 76.0, "diner": 78.0, "taste": 80.0, "endorsement": 68.0, "soft_ad_penalty": 2.0, "total": 74.6}, "evidence": {"diner_quotes": [{"quote": "东莱馋房不愧是首屈一指的招牌之选，葱烧海参切下去很有弹性，吃起来软软糯糯的，浓郁的葱香配上一口米饭太适合不过了。油淋鸟贝这种鲜香脆弹，油爆海螺也仍然是以比较纯粹的方式来展现海螺原有的甜味。", "dish": "葱烧海参/油爆海螺/油淋鸟贝", "source": "抖音", "url": "https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/6984336056720166152", "date": "2021-07-13"}, {"quote": "油爆海螺、明虾烧菜芯、油淋鸟贝、九转大肠、葱烧海参等招牌菜被食客们如数家珍，人均消费150-250元不等，丰俭由人，不设包厢低消，既适合家庭聚餐又能满足商务宴请之需。", "dish": "招牌鲁菜系列", "source": "Gourmet Talks", "url": "https://www.gourmettalks.com/index.php?id=808", "date": "2022-09-13"}, {"quote": "坚持不使用中央厨房或半成品，所有主辅食材和酱料的处理均由后厨一一料理。明虾烧菜芯、油爆海螺是招牌。", "dish": "明虾烧菜芯", "source": "TimeOut上海", "url": "https://www.timeoutshanghai.cn/features/6750.html", "date": "2026-08-27"}], "platform_scores": [{"platform": "大众点评", "score": null, "review_count": null, "url": "https://www.gourmettalks.com/index.php?id=808"}], "negative_signals": ["陆家嘴商圈商务客为主，性价比一般", "午市14:00后很多菜售罄", "2楼大堂3楼包房，环境偏商务"], "soft_ad_flags": [], "traffic_signals": ["后疫情时代以绝佳性价比和稳定客流展现实力", "金融圈商务宴请常客"]}, "sources": [{"title": "Gourmet Talks: 东莱馋房品海鲜珍馐", "url": "https://www.gourmettalks.com/index.php?id=808", "type": "news"}, {"title": "TimeOut上海：东莱馋房秋日限定", "url": "https://www.timeoutshanghai.cn/features/6750.html", "type": "overseas_media"}, {"title": "抖音：陆家嘴高端鲁菜东莱馋房", "url": "https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/6984336056720166152", "type": "ugc"}], "data_updated_at": "2026-09-23", "notes": "【discovery来源】由『上海 东莱馋房 鲁菜 胶东 海鲜』在Gourmet Talks/TimeOut/抖音捞到。东莱餐饮集团副品牌，环球金融中心2-3楼。集团另有晶品购物中心4楼店。精确楼层门牌待回填，电话待补。", "_warnings": ["高端店缺电话，建议补预订方式"]}
{"name": "老山东·鲁菜馆(陆家嘴店)", "name_en": "Lao Shandong Fengwei Caiguan", "match_restaurant_id": null, "brand_group": "老山东鲁菜馆", "brand_confirmed": true, "scene": "正餐", "cuisine_paths": [["中餐", "鲁菜", "济南菜(历下派)"]], "form": "Casual Dining", "meals": ["午餐", "晚餐"], "ingredients": ["海鲜", "肉禽", "面"], "awards": {"michelin": "无", "black_pearl": 0, "source_url": null}, "special_tags": ["可预订", "包间"], "price_avg": 198, "price_range": "¥170-220", "tier": "中档", "district": "浦东新区", "address": "上海市浦东新区浦东南路379号金穗大厦6楼(近浦东大道)", "business_area": "陆家嘴", "lat": 31.241, "lng": 121.503, "coord_source": "manual", "phone": "02168869778", "booking_method": "电话预订/到店；11:00-13:30 17:00-20:30", "signature_dishes": ["高唐酱驴肉", "九转大肠", "葱烧海参", "德州扒鸡", "海鲜疙瘩汤", "拔丝地瓜"], "status": "active", "closed_date": null, "closed_source": null, "scores": {"objective": 80.0, "diner": 78.0, "taste": 80.0, "endorsement": 65.0, "soft_ad_penalty": 2.0, "total": 75.9}, "evidence": {"diner_quotes": [{"quote": "老山东鲁菜馆真的是很推荐，高唐驴肉这道菜可是招牌中的招牌，驴肉炖的软烂入味特别好吃。山东烤鸭外皮酥脆肉质鲜嫩多汁。铁锅鱼饼Q弹有劲。3-4人菜400都不到。", "dish": "高唐酱驴肉/山东烤鸭", "source": "抖音", "url": "https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7407680277964672306", "date": "2024-08-27"}, {"quote": "九转大肠可以点小份6个，大肠不脆感觉可以再炸掉点油。葱烧海参现在有活动比原价便宜30-40元。德州扒鸡可以点半只。烹茄子甜口。", "dish": "九转大肠/葱烧海参", "source": "携程笔记", "url": "https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=176642579", "date": "2025-07-27"}, {"quote": "Trip.com 4.7/5。 nearly 20 years of history, established by the Shandong Government's Shanghai office. Rustic decor, generous portions, warm welcoming atmosphere typical of state-run eateries.", "dish": "鲁菜正餐", "source": "Trip.com / Hills Shanghai", "url": "https://hillsshanghai.com/blogs/explore-shanghai/where-to-eat-four-recommended-lu-cuisine-restaurants-in-shanghai", "date": "2024-08-24"}], "platform_scores": [{"platform": "Trip.com", "score": 4.7, "review_count": 7442, "url": "https://hk.trip.com/restaurant/china/shanghai/detail/lao-shandong-fengwei-caiguan-11143961/"}], "negative_sign